{"speciesId":546,"names":{"fr":"Doudouvet","es":"Cottonee","en":"Cottonee","ja":"モンメン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Si on l’attaque, il projette un nuage de coton. L’ennemi le confond avec lui, ce qui permet à Doudouvet de s’enfuir."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When attacked, it escapes by shooting cotton from its body. The cotton serves as a decoy to distract the attacker."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il dérive librement au gré du vent. Les jours de pluie, il s’alourdit et se réfugie au pied des arbres."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They go wherever the wind takes them. On rainy days, their bodies are heavier, so they take shelter beneath big trees."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Perhaps because they feel more at ease in a group, they stick to others they find. They end up looking like a cloud."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Perhaps because they feel more at ease in a group, they stick to others they find. They end up looking like a cloud."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Si on l’attaque, il projette un nuage de coton. L’ennemi le confond avec lui, ce qui permet à Doudouvet de s’enfuir."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Despide motas de algodón cuando lo atacan para confundir a los enemigos y poner pies en polvorosa."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When attacked, it escapes by shooting cotton from its body. The cotton serves as a decoy to distract the attacker."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"襲われると 体から 綿を 飛ばす。 敵が 綿を モンメンと 間違えている すきに 逃げるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Pokémon à l’instinct grégaire, ils se collent les uns aux autres et finissent par former un gros nuage."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Quizá por el hecho de que se relajan al estar con los suyos, forman un grupo al encontrar amigos y parecen nubes."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Perhaps because they feel more at ease in a group, they stick to others they find. They end up looking like a cloud."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"集団で いると 落ち着くのか 仲間を みつけると くっついて いつのまにか 雲のように なる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Si on l’attaque, il projette un nuage de coton. L’ennemi le confond avec lui, ce qui permet à Doudouvet de s’enfuir."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Despide motas de algodón cuando lo atacan para confundir a los enemigos y poner pies en polvorosa."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"When attacked, it escapes by shooting cotton from its body. The cotton serves as a decoy to distract the attacker."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"襲われると 体から 綿を 飛ばす。 敵が 綿を モンメンと 間違えている すきに 逃げるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Pokémon à l’instinct grégaire, ils se collent les uns aux autres et finissent par former un gros nuage."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Quizá por el hecho de que se relajan al estar con los suyos, forman un grupo al encontrar amigos y parecen nubes."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Perhaps because they feel more at ease in a group, they stick to others they find. They end up looking like a cloud."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"集団で いると 落ち着くのか 仲間を みつけると くっついて いつのまにか 雲のように なる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Les Doudouvet se collent entre eux quand ils se rencontrent. Lorsqu’ils sont assez nombreux, ils forment de véritables cumulonimbus vivants."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Cuando se encuentran con amigos, se agrupan. Si son muchos, a veces pueden llegar a adquirir un aspecto semejante al de un cúmulo de nubes."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"When it finds others of its kind, they all stick together. When enough of them have collected, the mass resembles a cumulonimbus cloud."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"仲間を みつけると くっつく。 あまりに たくさん くっつきすぎて 入道雲 みたいになることも。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Le coton qu’il produit est utilisé dans la confection d’oreillers et de couettes de haute qualité, qui allient légèreté et fraîcheur."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Los colchones o almohadas rellenos del algodón que suelta Cottonee son un producto de alta calidad por su ligereza y transpirabilidad."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Pillows and beds stuffed with cotton exhaled by Cottonee are soft and puffy, light and airy— altogether top quality."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"モンメンの 吐く 綿を 使った 枕や 布団は 軽くて 通気の 良い 高級品だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il projette un nuage de coton pour se protéger. Quand il pleut, son coton s’imbibe d’eau et le rend si lourd qu’il est incapable de bouger."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Lanza bolas de algodón como defensa. Cuando llueve y se moja, se vuelve tan pesado que le resulta difícil moverse."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"To protect itself, it shoots cotton from its body. When it gets wet in the rain, its cotton grows moist and heavy, and it can’t move as well."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"綿を 飛ばして 身を 守る。 雨に 濡れると 綿が 湿って 重くなり 身動きが とれなくなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Lorsqu’on l’attaque, il sème du coton pour faire diversion. Celui-ci repousse tout de suite."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Cuando lo atacan despide bolas de algodón a modo de señuelo. Estas, sin embargo, vuelven a crecer enseguida."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"When attacked, it expels cotton from its body to create a diversion. The cotton it loses grows back in quickly."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"襲われると 身体の ワタを 飛ばして おとりにする。 飛ばした ワタは また すぐに 生えてくるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il sème du coton pour se protéger. Il lui arrive d’être emporté par une tempête à l’autre bout du monde."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Lanza bolas de algodón para defenderse. A veces, la fuerza de un tifón llega a arrastrarlo hasta el otro extremo del mundo."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It shoots cotton from its body to protect itself. If it gets caught up in hurricane-strength winds, it can get sent to the other side of the Earth."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"綿を 飛ばして 身を 守る。 台風の 風に 流され 地球の 裏側に いくことも。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Les marques de luxe utilisent les étoffes splendides issues du mélange des cotons de Doudouvet et de Blancoton."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Combinando los algodones de los Cottonee y Eldegoss se obtiene una tela exquisita, que usan las marcas más exclusivas."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Weaving together the cotton of both Cottonee and Eldegoss produces exquisite cloth that’s highly prized by many luxury brands."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"モンメンと ワタシラガの 綿を 混ぜて 織った 生地は 美しく 高級ブランドで 使われる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":546,"moves":[{"name":"absorb","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-drain","learns":[[11,"level-up",13],[14,"level-up",13],[15,"level-up",13],[16,"level-up",13],[17,"level-up",13],[18,"level-up",13],[20,"level-up",12],[25,"level-up",12]]},{"name":"leech-seed","learns":[[11,"level-up",8],[14,"level-up",8],[15,"level-up",8],[16,"level-up",8],[17,"level-up",8],[18,"level-up",8],[20,"level-up",30],[25,"level-up",30]]},{"name":"growth","learns":[[11,"level-up",4],[14,"level-up",4],[15,"level-up",4],[16,"level-up",4],[17,"level-up",4],[18,"level-up",4],[20,"level-up",18],[25,"level-up",18]]},{"name":"razor-leaf","learns":[[11,"level-up",19],[14,"level-up",19],[15,"level-up",19],[16,"level-up",19],[17,"level-up",19],[18,"level-up",19],[20,"level-up",15],[25,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[11,"level-up",46],[11,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",46],[14,"machine",0],